  "content": "\n\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/city-craft\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"http://cf.way2muchnoise.eu/short_985069.svg?badge_style=flat\" alt=\"CurseForge\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252frexs-city-craft\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/rexs-city-craft?logo=modrinth&label=&suffix= &style=flat&color=242629&labelColor=5ca424&logoColor=1c1c1c\" alt=\"Modrinth\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/city-craft\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cf.way2muchnoise.eu/versions/985069(266fff).svg?badge_style=flat\" alt=\"支持版本\"></a> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/ycRJJk8EXV\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/523112426913267713?color=282828&logo=discord&style=flat&label=&labelColor=B6BCEA\" alt=\"Discord\"></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/CityCraft/blob/master/src/main/resources/logo.png?raw=true\" alt=\"标志\" width=\"400\"><br><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/General/blob/main/page_decorations/line_curved.png?raw=true\" alt=\"装饰线\" width=\"2000\"></p>\n<h2>📖 简介</h2>\n<p>本模组添加了与原版兼容的街道、路标及其他装饰方块，让你的世界蜕变为一座宏伟的城市！</p>\n<hr>\n<h3>主要功能：</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>与技术类模组高度兼容</li>\n<li>丰富的道路方块种类</li>\n<li>来自世界各地的路标、交通护栏、排水井盖等</li>\n<li>额外的装饰方块（如墙壁、栅栏、灯柱等）</li>\n<li>交通信号灯、路灯与灯笼</li>\n<li>在沥青路面上移动速度提升</li>\n<li>与原版及生存模式友好兼容</li>\n<li>部分方块基于原版纹理制作，完美兼容材质包！</li>\n<li>自发光纹理</li>\n<li>连接纹理</li>\n<li>版本检测器</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/General/blob/main/page_decorations/line.png?raw=true\" alt=\"装饰线\" width=\"2000\"></p>\n<h2>📷 展示</h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/94iqI5Ec/images/c71b6af7af76f7f8d6cef8a7a7f82134ba40503c.png\" alt=\"街道\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/General/blob/main/2024-03-22_16.38.21.png?raw=true\" alt=\"城市\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/General/blob/main/2024-03-15_15.04.48.png?raw=true\" alt=\"道路方块\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/General/blob/main/2024-03-24_23.05.25.png?raw=true\" alt=\"路标\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/General/blob/main/2024-07-02_19.08.43.png?raw=true\" alt=\"路标\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/General/blob/main/2024-07-02_19.08.33.png?raw=true\" alt=\"墙壁与交通护栏\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/General/blob/main/2024-07-02_19.08.58.png?raw=true\" alt=\"交通信号灯\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/General/blob/main/2025-09-17_21.53.16.png?raw=true\" alt=\"混凝土方块\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/General/blob/main/page_decorations/line.png?raw=true\" alt=\"装饰线\" width=\"2000\"></p>\n<h2>🗃️ 依赖项</h2>\n<h3>已支持集成：</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>The Lost Cities</strong> [&ge; MC 1.21]\n<ul>\n<li>使用新的 CityCraft 方块生成城市</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/the-lost-cities\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">CurseForge</a> | <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fthe-lost-cities\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Modrinth</a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><strong>Immersive Engineering</strong>\n<ul>\n<li>提供额外合成配方</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-engineering\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">CurseForge</a> | <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fimmersiveengineering\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Modrinth</a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><strong>Mekanism</strong>\n<ul>\n<li>提供额外合成配方</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/mekanism\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">CurseForge</a> | <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fmekanism\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Modrinth</a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><strong>Just Enough Items (JEI)</strong>\n<ul>\n<li>提供额外的信息页面并显示所有合成配方</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/jei\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">CurseForge</a> | <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fjei\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Modrinth</a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><strong>Continuity</strong>\n<ul>\n<li>启用模组的自发光与连接纹理功能</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/continuity\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">CurseForge</a> | <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcontinuity\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Modrinth</a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><strong>MoreMcmeta Emissive Textures</strong>\n<ul>\n<li>启用模组的自发光纹理</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/moremcmeta-emissive-forge\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">CurseForge</a> | <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fmoremcmeta-emissive\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Modrinth</a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><strong>Shimmer</strong> [&ge; MC 1.21]\n<ul>\n<li>启用彩色闪电效果</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/shimmer\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">CurseForge</a> | <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fshimmer!\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Modrinth</a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><strong>Just Enough Effect Descriptions (JEED)</strong>\n<ul>\n<li>在 JEI 中提供生物效果说明</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/just-enough-effect-descriptions-jeed\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">CurseForge</a> | <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fjust-enough-effect-descriptions-jeed\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Modrinth</a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/XxRexRaptorxX/General/blob/main/page_decorations/line.png?raw=true\" alt=\"装饰线\" width=\"2000\"></p>\n<h2>🎮 我的其他模组！</h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/additional-structures\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://github.c